summary:
#Colts WR Alec Pierce received another PRP injection in his left ankle, a league source confirms to @TheAthleticNFL.

Pierce underwent left ankle surgery in March. This is the second time he’s received a PRP injection this offseason.

@AdamSchefter and @By_NathanBrown were on it.

